                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The Department of State Hospitals - Napa&nbsp;(DSH-Napa) is hiring intermittent temporary Student Assistants in the Fire Department.&nbsp;The Student Assistants will be under the supervision of the Fire Chief, and will perform the full range of fire prevention, fire suppression and other assigned duties, tasks, and responsiblities. This is a great educational and training opportunity while attending college classes.<br /><br />Applications will be accepted until the positions are&nbsp;filled. Multiple cut-off dates are set for application submission: February&nbsp;14, 2025, March&nbsp;14, 2025, April&nbsp;14, 2025, May&nbsp;14, 2025, June&nbsp;14, 2025&nbsp;and July&nbsp;14, 2025. Applications received after a cut-off date will be processed for the next cut-off date listed.<br /><br />Applications may be pre-screened. Only the most qualified candidates&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;the minimum qualifications (see below) will be considered for an interview. All interested qualified candidates that meet the&nbsp;criteria should submit a State of California STD&nbsp;678 Employment Application online, hand deliver or mail to the Human Resources - Examination/Hiring Unit.<br /><br /> </span><div><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Minimum Qualifications</span></strong></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Proof of application for, or enrollment as a student in, an appropriate college or university program.</span></div></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /> </span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please be certain that your application package is thorough, completely describes your work experience, and&nbsp;transcripts have been uploaded. <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong style="text-decoration-line: underline;">INCOMPLETE APPLICATIONS WILL NOT BE CONSIDERED</strong></span>.<br /> <br /></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please include &quot;Student Assistant-Fire Fighter&nbsp;JC-463181&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">in the &quot;Job Title(s)&quot; Section of the application if you are not electronically submitting your application. Electronic submission of applications and transcripts are highly suggested.<br /><br /></span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial;">This posting may be used to fill future vacancies in accordance with 2 CCR §249.3</span></span></p><h3 style="text-align: left; margin: 11pt 0pt; background-color: #f5f5f5;">
